# Pin this project to the public npm registry.
#
# Without this, `npm install` on a Wix machine resolves through
# npm.dev.wixpress.com and writes those URLs into package-lock.json. The lockfile
# then only works behind the Wix network, and `npm ci` on a GitHub Actions runner
# fails before the build starts. Every dependency here is public, so there is
# nothing to gain from the internal proxy.
registry=https://registry.npmjs.org/
